title: Make exact coverage-path tests deterministic and cross-platform
description: "Disposition CodeRabbit findings by removing permission-bit dependence, injecting runner executables instead of mutating process.execPath, verifying duplicate-declaration reports against the compiled head, and replacing POSIX-only coverage-path fixtures with Node fixtures."
