acceptance_criteria: coverage-path tests run without root or Windows skips; fake runner behavior is injected explicitly; no duplicate declarations remain; exact 100/100/100 and release gates pass
resolution: Introduced typed runtime injection and platform-independent Node fixtures for every coverage-path process failure.
expected_result: "Coverage-path tests run deterministically without process-global mutation, POSIX shebangs, permission bits, or skipped branches."
actual_result: 118 tests pass with zero skips and exact 100/100/100; typecheck confirms the duplicate-declaration report is not present on the exact head.
